  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="transcription" xml:id="transcription_aad_0171" xml:lang="en">
          <div type="letter">
        <pb facs="https://iiif.acdh.oeaw.ac.at/aad/aad_00515/" ed="1r" type="sheet"/>
            <div type="letter_message" hand="#type_black_fox">
              <opener>
                <dateline>  
                  <date>
                    <lb/><space quantity="32" unit="char"/>April 24, l970
                  </date>
                </dateline>
                <salute>
                  <lb/>Dear <rs type="person" ref="#amp_person_1">Wystan</rs>,
                </salute>
              </opener>
              <p>
                <lb/><space quantity="3" unit="char"/>Aside from a <subst><del rend="overtyped" hand="#type_black_fox">b</del><add place="superimposed" hand="#type_black_fox">B</add></subst>aba who got lost singing the breakfast
                <lb/>chatter scene and who had trouble projecting her voic<subst><del rend="overtyped" hand="#type_black_fox">3</del><add place="superimposed" hand="#type_black_fox"><unclear>e</unclear></add></subst>
                <lb/>over the orchestra, the <rs type="org" ref="#amp_organization_365">Julliard</rs> <rs type="lit_work" ref="#lit_work_id_3">"Rake"</rs> was a smooth,
                <lb/>articulated <rs ana="#ana_146">production</rs>.<space quantity="2" unit="char"/>Shadow, in particular, was
                <lb/>excellent (one really could follow his argument for
                <lb/>the marriage).<space quantity="2" unit="char"/>My major complaint was about the sets,
                <lb/>which were based on a <del rend="overtyped" hand="#type_black_fox">raised<space quantity="1" unit="char"/></del>platform, looking rather
                <lb/>like a boxing ring, surrounded by empty stage.<space quantity="2" unit="char"/>Blown-
                <lb/>up details of the <rs type="person" ref="#amp_person_559">Hogarth</rs><del rend="overtyped" hand="#type_black_fox">s</del> engravings, mounted on
                <lb/>revolving poles, were used to suggest the period.
                <lb/>The direction was for the most part efficient and 
                <lb/>inventive, sometimes over-inventive: whores and roaring
                <lb/>boys were made to dance, or stomp, a sort of reel
                <lb/>aro<del rend="metamark" hand="#hand_black_fox"><space quantity="1" unit="char"/></del>und Tom and Mother Goose as they fucked on a table.
                <lb/>There were other lapses<subst><del rend="overtyped" hand="#type_black_fox">;</del><add place="superimposed" hand="#type_black_fox">:</add></subst> Baba forgot or was not dir-
                <lb/>ected to remove her beard when she appeared in the epi-
                <lb/>logue.<space quantity="2" unit="char"/>Even so, I was highly entertained by the pro-
                <lb/>duction and I am very grateful for your kindness in
                <lb/>providing tickets.              
              </p>
              <p>
                <lb/><space quantity="2" unit="char"/>I must tell you that, among the highly distin<subst><del rend="overtyped" hand="#type_black_fox">q</del><add place="superimposed" hand="#type_black_fox">g</add></subst>uished
                <lb/>audience--including <rs type="person" ref="#amp_person_560">John D. Rockefeller III</rs>--an ele-
                <lb/>gant gentlement of a certain age was observed wearing
                <lb/>house slippers exactly th<subst><del rend="overtyped" hand="#type_black_fox">3</del><add place="superimposed" hand="#type_black_fox">e</add></subst> same style as yours.
              </p>
              <p>
                <lb/><space quantity="3" unit="char"/>Some good news: my mother is getting married
                <lb/>May 24 to a man of 60 named Mr. Cole.<space quantity="2" unit="char"/>I've been
                <lb/>inv<subst><del rend="overtyped" hand="#type_black_fox">e<gap reason="illegible" unit="char" quantity="1"></gap></del><add place="superimposed" hand="#type_black_fox">it</add></subst>ed to "give the bride away."<space quantity="2" unit="char"/>Also, I've
                <lb/>unexpectedly been given a raise of $ll00, bringing
                <lb/>my annual salary to a comfortable $l3,000.
              </p>
              <p>
                <lb/><space quantity="3" unit="char"/>Many thanks for your postcard from <rs ana="#ana_147"><rs type="place" ref="#amp_place_id_359">Jerus<subst><del rend="overwritten" hand="#hand_black_fox">e</del><add place="superimposed" hand="#hand_black_fox">a</add></subst>le<del rend="metamark" hand="#hand_black_fox">u</del>m</rs></rs>. I
                <lb/>was very pleased with <rs type="person" ref="#amp_person_4">Chester</rs>'s note.
              </p>
              <closer>
                <salute>
                  <lb/><space quantity="3" unit="char"/>Regards to <rs type="person" ref="#amp_person_4">Chester</rs>.
                </salute>
                <salute>
                  <lb/><space quantity="22" unit="char"/>Love, always
                </salute>
                <signed hand="#hand_black_fox">
                  <lb/><rs type="person" ref="#amp_person_558">Orlan</rs>
                </signed>
              </closer>
            </div>
        <pb facs="https://iiif.acdh.oeaw.ac.at/aad/aad_00516/" ed="1v" type="sheet"/>
            <div>
              <ab hand="#hand_blue_unident_0171">
                <lb/>25
              </ab>
            </div>
          </div>
